title: Valdemar Voss
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, labor
card-image: img/portraits/WoytinskyWladimir.jpg
view-if: woytinsky_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Valdemar Voss

Valdemar Voss is an exile from the <span style="color: #D50032;">Central Union</span>—a moderate who fled its radicals—and the chief economist of the <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> Free Guild federation. His primary idea is to use massive government spending as a way of stimulating demand to extricate us from the depression.

- @plan
- @carry_out_policy
- @depression
- @root: Return to main

@plan
title: Adopt the Voss Renewal Plan!
subtitle: Convincing the rest of the party to support the Voss Renewal Plan.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted == 0 and wtb_concept and veran_crash_seen and ((labor_strength >= center_strength) and (labor_strength >= left_strength)) and wtb_points >= 160
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if veran_crash_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Voss Renewal Plan. ?][? if wtb_points < 160 : The Voss Renewal Plan is still being ironed out. ?][? if (labor_strength < center_strength or labor_strength < left_strength): The labor faction is not strong enough. ?]
go-to: wtb_proposed

@carry_out_policy
title: Carry out the economic plan.
subtitle: If we are in government, we can carry out a public works program such as the Voss Renewal Plan.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if wtb_adopted == 0 : We have not yet adopted an economic plan. ?][? if works_program >= 2 : We have already started implementing the plan. ?][? if economic_minister_party != "Marcher" and finance_minister_party != "Marcher" or not marcher_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> doesn't occupy the Finance or Economic ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted and wtb_implemented <= 1 and economic_minister_party == "Marcher" or finance_minister_party == "Marcher" and marcher_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer -= 12
go-to: economic_policy


@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of the economic crisis.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted == 0 and veran_crash_seen == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if veran_crash_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Voss Renewal Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; wtb_points += 15

[? if not wtb_concept: Voss, Whell, and Bayle, has been working together to draft a plan for getting us out of the depression. Voss canvasses in favor of this policy through the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and the Free Guilds. ?][? if wtb_concept: The Voss Renewal Plan, named for its primary supporters Voss, Whell, and Bayle, has been adopted as the Free Guilds' plan for getting us out of the depression. Voss canvasses in favor of this policy through the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and the Free Guilds. ?]
